<title>POLAND: VISTULA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.68 vs   0.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.76 vs   1.39</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.61 vs   0.97</p>
<p> Sales		    8.36 vs   7.73</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.90 vs   2.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.75 vs   3.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.12 vs   2.43</p>
<p> Sales		   18.44 vs  15.76</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Odziezowego Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
